{"ID":"20240205153730-e6pgs2x","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240205153730-e6pgs2x","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240205153730-e6pgs2x\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206093012-ujh5bm8\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240614125356-rtfddye\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:1254,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240614125655-80ijvak\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:8,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:8\u0026#125;","title":"380补23薤白（藠头）","type":"doc","updated":"20240705130724"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240206093012-ujh5bm8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206093012-ujh5bm8","updated":"20240206093015"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【产地】\t主产东北地区及江苏、湖北等地。\n【性状】\t小根蒜：鳞茎吐不规则卵圆形，长0.52.0cm，直径0.71.8cm。表面黄白色或淡黄棕色，皱缩，半透明，有缘沟及皱纹或有类白色膜质鳞片包被，顶端有残存茎痕，基部有突起的鳞茎盘。质坚硬，角质样，不易破碎，断面黄白色。微有蒜气，味微辣。\n藠头：鳞长卵形，直径11.5cm。长梗薤白：鳞茎卵球形，直径12cm。\n天蓝小根蒜：鳞茎近球形，直径1"},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBackslashContent","Data":"~"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2cm。\n【性味】\t辛、苦，温。\n【功效】\t胸痹心痛彻背；胸脘痞闷；咳喘痰多；脘腹疼痛；泄痢后重；白带；疮疖痈肿；通阳散结，行气导滞。"}]},{"ID":"20240206093006-yeuxa7a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206093006-yeuxa7a","updated":"20240206093006"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240206093006-gzm5jr6.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240205162207-6xwfnwb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240205162207-6xwfnwb","updated":"20240828160915"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"薤白"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/薤白-20240205162207-0hdr6vg.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240705130652-esikq53","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240705130652-esikq53","updated":"20240828160918"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 560px;","style":"width: 550px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240705130652-f0tr2td.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 550px;\" parent-style=\"width: 560px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​"}]},{"ID":"20240705125609-w8j7ies","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240705125609-w8j7ies","updated":"20240828160919"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 395px;","style":"width: 385px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"薤白1"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/薤白1-20240705125609-xb57so1.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 385px;\" parent-style=\"width: 395px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 482px;","style":"width: 472px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"薤白8"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/薤白8-20240705130616-g93o18g.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 472px;\" parent-style=\"width: 482px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​"}]},{"ID":"20240705130629-y